**Title:** Whispering Hills: A Journey of Patience and Peace

**Description:** Join Harper, an eleven-year-old with a heart full of patience and acceptance, as they embark on a tranquil journey through the rolling hills with their faithful hedgehog companion, Pip. As the sun sets and paints the landscape in hues of gold and lavender, Harper discovers the gentle rhythm of nature and the peace it brings. This episode invites you to wander alongside Harper, feeling the earth beneath your feet and the evening breeze on your skin, fostering a deep sense of calm and relaxation. As Harper learns to embrace the challenges with grace, listeners are gently lulled into a peaceful slumber, leaving behind the worries of the day.

